  m_text: 'The astrolabe is apparently a very finicky device who sometimes decides
    to strand you in one time period or another. Don''t panic, there''s a backup!


    If
    you get stuck in the present or the past, you can use your map to fast travel.
    Want to travel to the past? Select the "Switch Map View" button in the upper
    left corner.


    You may fast travel to any of the light blue

    waypoints. '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
